# The global core.excludesfile (~/.gitignore) ignores ".claude/" and ".codex",
# which would also hide the literal-dotted-dir stow packages below. Re-include
# just those paths so they can be tracked here. (We can't use stow's --dotfiles
# "dot-claude" naming to dodge the rule: GNU Stow 2.3.1's --dotfiles fails to
# descend into an existing target dir like ~/.claude or ~/.codex.)
!dotfiles/claude/.claude/
!dotfiles/claude/.claude/**
!dotfiles/codex/.codex/
!dotfiles/codex/.codex/**
